  "adaptations": [
    "Trimmed unused calendar/map CSS; retained TailAdmin theme and base utilities; added local Outfit font and business layout styles.",
    "Adapted next.config.ts for this standalone webpack/SVGR frontend.",
    "Moved and adapted src/svg.d.ts to src/types/svg.d.ts for SVGR component imports.",
    "Search SVG extracted from the pinned free AppHeader; icon exports updated without custom geometry.",
    "Bell SVG paint changed to currentColor; geometry unchanged.",
    "Imported free ThemeContext and ThemeToggleButton; added accessible theme label.",
    "Copied free grid.svg to public/favicon.svg for the prototype icon.",
    "Business screens, application navigation, chart integration and shared dialog/focus behavior are custom, not Pro source.",
    "Normalized trailing whitespace in imported SVG/config text and OFL text; geometry and license wording unchanged.",
    "2026-09-24: removed 50 imported files that the app no longer ships (demo user/product images, unused icons, and the button/modal/table components); their upstream hashes remain in git history at tag audit-base-20260924."
